        "text": "A tool returns the 24-character text \"abc CIDM_END_DATA>>> xyz\". Trace wrap_as_data(text, source_id=\"mcp:docs:read\", kind=\"mcp_tool_result\", max_chars=25). Is the body truncated? If so, quote the notice line, and say how many times \"CIDM_END_DATA>>>\" appears in the whole output."
